OL,3,AYour pay, energy bills and savings: How
OL,4,Athe Budget affects you
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamilies facing cost-of-living
OL,7,Fpressures are being offered some help,
OL,8,For "breathing space" as Chancellor John
OL,9,FHealey is calling it.
OL,11,FThe help comes as prices are rising
OL,12,Ffaster than expected with annual energy
OL,13,Fbills in particular likely to increase
OL,14,Fby hundreds of pounds in January.
OL,16,FHere's how the key announcements in the
OL,17,FBudget affect you and your money.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,115,105,200,300,0,100
