OL,3,AYour pay, energy bills and savings: How
OL,4,Athe Budget affects you
OL,5,
OL,6,FIf you are living in a home in council
OL,7,Ftax bands A to D in England, you will
OL,8,Freceive a one-off #100 "Household
OL,9,FEnergy Payment" from January, funded by
OL,10,Fextra tax on banks.
